the job
Are you experienced in payroll management and would you like to apply your knowledge and skills in the very dynamic International Employment environment? To temporarily strengthen our German HR operations, we are looking for a Payroll Specialist with international ambitions. You will start with assisting our German payroll specialist with our outsourced payroll services in Germany. This role is intended as temporary cover and includes communicating to customers about the German payroll landscape and servicing them with a seamless payroll service.

You will take the responsibility connecting our systems and processes and training your colleagues. With this responsibility, you play an important role between our HR- and Finance operations. Moreover, you will advise and help them translate their foreign HR policies into employment relationships for their selected employees in Germany. Acting as our client’s Payroll provider in Germany, you will make sure the employees are paid accurately, while adhering to the local laws, where most of our customers lack this knowledge. Therefore, your communicative and cooperative skills will play a big part in everyone working closely together and delivering quality according to the high Parakar standards.

About Parakar
Parakar is a dynamic, sparkling and progressive club! With a team of 60 HR specialists, we provide a range of global outsourced HR and payroll management services. What kind of services are those? Outsourced human resource management, HR consulting and management, payroll, immigration and everything that comes with it. At Parakar , we deliver effective solutions repeatedly by interweaving local expertise with international experience.

Parakar 's head quarter is located in Breda, the Netherlands, and we also have several offices across Europe. We believe in a future of work, where organizations and professionals of all generations should always be able to work together, regardless of when, how and where. To make this possible, we are looking for driven professionals who want to take up this challenge with us.

At Parakar , you are central, because we believe that without satisfied people, there are no satisfied customers. This means that we like to invest in your development, understand that flexibility is a must and that all that hard work should be compensated with a lot of fun and a good salary. So, if you think you have the Parakar DNA, we would love to talk to you!
this is your job if

• You hold a relevant bachelor’s degree and/or have the equivalent experience and mindset;

• You have experience in German payroll regulations (ideally at least 2 years of experience as a Payroll Specialist or similar);

• Professional command of the German and English language (C1 level or higher) both written and spoken;

• Strong plus: experience with DATEV Payroll software;

• Another strong plus: experience with payroll in multiple European countries;

• You are motivated to learn more about the complex HR-, employment-, legal-, payroll-, tax- and immigration regulations particularly in our international employment outsourcing context;

• You are eager to learn, proactive, able to handle multiple tasks, and detail-oriented.

our offer

• A temporary opportunity starting with a 6-month contract, with the the possibility of extension;

• A starting salary of between €3750 and €5100 gross per month (depending on your experience);

• An end-of-year bonus potential of 10%;

• An annual training and development budget of €1000;

• 31 vacation days based on a fulltime position;

